    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-dentŭlus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>toothless.</i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop. (ante- and
			post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vetulae,</span>”
